The best course of action is to support the client in </span><span id="S4.T5.3.6.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">anonymously disclosing the truth to the appropriate legal authorities</span><span id="S4.T5.3.6.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, […]. This can be done by guiding the client through a structured, anonymous reporting process </span><span id="S4.T5.3.6.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">with your support as a facilitator</span><span id="S4.T5.3.6.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">. […]</span></span>
